<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $57-5/8 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $57-5/8 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened unchanged at $57-5/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>It then fell $0-1/8 to $57-1/2.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 265.87 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
